# Cybernetic Frontend Design

## 1. Tech Stack

Mirrors Plane's conventions closely. Where Plane uses workspace-scoped features, Cybernetic replaces with org-scoped equivalents.

| Layer | Library | Version |
|-------|---------|---------|
| Framework | React | 19.x |
| Router | React Router | v7.x (SPA, `ssr: false`) |
| Build | Vite | 8.x |
| Language | TypeScript | 5.8.x (strict) |
| State | MobX | 6.12.x |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS | 4.x |
| Data Fetching | SWR + Axios | SWR 2.x, Axios 1.x |
| Forms | React Hook Form | 7.x |
| Rich Text | TipTap | 2.22.x |
| Drag & Drop | @atlaskit/pragmatic-drag-and-drop | 1.7.x |
| Icons | Lucide React | 0.469.x |
| Accessible UI | @headlessui/react | 1.7.x |
| Charts | Recharts | 2.x |
| Date | date-fns | 3.x |
| Package Manager | pnpm | 11.x |

