## 5. MobX Store Architecture

### Root Store (`CoreRootStore`)
Single class composed from all domain stores. Passed via React context through `StoreContext`. Each store receives a back-reference to the root for cross-store access. Implements `resetOnSignOut()`.

```
store/
├── root.store.ts
├── auth/
│   └── auth.store.ts           # currentUser, isAuthenticated, login(), logout()
├── org/
│   └── organization.store.ts   # currentOrg, orgMap, fetchOrg(), updateOrg()
├── department/
│   └── department.store.ts     # deptMap, rootDepts, fetchDepts(), fetchChildren()
├── team/
│   └── team.store.ts           # teamMap, fetchTeams(), fetchMembers()
├── person/
│   └── person.store.ts         # personMap, fetchPersons(), searchPersons()
├── objective/
│   └── objective.store.ts      # objectiveMap, fetchObjectives(), fetchByScope()
├── key-result/
│   └── key-result.store.ts     # krMap, fetchKRs(), updateValue(), fetchByObjective()
├── initiative/
│   └── initiative.store.ts     # initiativeMap, fetchInitiatives(), linkKR(), unlinkKR()
├── task/
│   └── task.store.ts           # taskMap, groupedTaskIds, fetchTasks(), quickAdd()
├── tracking/
│   └── tracking.store.ts       # timelineMap, lifecycle actions (start/pause/complete/block)
├── knowledge/
│   └── knowledge.store.ts      # knowledgeMap, fetchKnowledge(), attachTask()
├── intervention/
│   └── intervention.store.ts   # interventionMap, linkKR(), unlinkKR()
├── alignment/
│   └── alignment.store.ts      # treeData, fetchTree(), link(), unlink()
├── label/
│   └── label.store.ts          # labelMap, fetchLabels(), createLabel()
├── file/
│   └── file.store.ts           # pendingUploads, requestSignature(), confirmUpload()
├── theme/
│   └── theme.store.ts          # mode (light/dark), toggle()
└── router/
    └── router.store.ts         # currentPath, push(), replace()
```

### Store Conventions (mirror Plane)
- All stores are MobX `makeObservable` classes
- Maps keyed by ID: `@observable.ref objectiveMap: Record<string, IObjective> = {}`
- Actions: `@action fetchObjectives = async () => {}`
- Computed views: `@computed get activeObjectives() { ... }`
- Component access: `const { objective } = useStore()` (hook over `useContext(StoreContext)`)

