## 6. Service Layer

All services extend a shared `APIService` base class (mirrors Plane's pattern).

### Base Service
```typescript
// core/services/api.service.ts
class APIService {
  protected baseURL: string;   // VITE_API_BASE_URL + "/api/v1"
  protected axiosInstance;     // withCredentials: true

  // Interceptors:
  //   response 401 → clear auth store + redirect /auth/sign-in
  //   request → attach Bearer token from auth store

  get(url, params?, config?)
  post(url, data?, config?)
  patch(url, data?, config?)
  put(url, data?, config?)
  delete(url, config?)
}
```

