## 10. Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 — Foundation (auth + shell)
- Monorepo setup: `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, shared `packages/ui` + `packages/types`
- `apps/web`: Vite + React Router v7 config, TypeScript, Tailwind
- Root store + `StoreContext` provider
- `APIService` base class + `AuthService`
- Auth routes: `/auth/sign-in`, auth guard, `AuthStore`
- App shell: `AppSidebar`, `OrgHeader`, `PageContainer`

### Phase 2 — Org Structure (read-mostly)
- `OrganizationStore`, `DepartmentStore`, `TeamStore`, `PersonStore`
- Settings pages: departments tree, teams list, members list, labels
- `PersonAvatar`, `StatusBadge`, `EmptyState` common components

### Phase 3 — OKR Core (objectives + KRs)
- `ObjectiveStore`, `KeyResultStore`
- Objectives list + detail + form
- KR list + progress bar + measurement form
- `ObjectiveScopeFilter`, `KRProgressBar`

### Phase 4 — Initiatives + Tracking
- `InitiativeStore`, `TrackingStore`
- Initiatives list + detail + lifecycle action bar
- Activity timeline view
- OKR alignment tree (`AlignmentStore` + `OKRTreeView`)

### Phase 5 — Tasks (Plane-core pattern)
- `TaskStore` with grouping + filtering (mirrors Plane's `IssueStore`)
- Task list/kanban views with `TaskListRoot` pattern
- Task detail panel, quick-add, assignees, labels
- Task lifecycle action bar

### Phase 6 — Knowledge Base
- `KnowledgeStore`
- Knowledge list + TipTap editor + attachments + external links
- Share panel, task linker
- `FileStore` + file upload flow

### Phase 7 — Interventions + Analytics
- `InterventionStore`
- Intervention list + KR linker
- Dashboard `OKRHealthCard`, `InitiativeStatusChart`, `RecentActivityFeed`
- Analytics page (Recharts charts for OKR progress over time)

### Phase 8 — Admin App
- `apps/admin` scaffold
- Organization management, person management, role assignment
- Email settings + test transport

