## Notes

- All routes under `/(authenticated)/` require a valid JWT; `AuthGuard` redirects to `/auth/sign-in` on 401.
- The org slug (`[orgSlug]`) replaces Plane's workspace slug. An `OrganizationContext` provider in `[orgSlug]/layout.tsx` loads and memoizes the current org.
- The task module intentionally mirrors Plane's issue module as closely as possible (same grouping/filtering/kanban architecture) since the backend's task data model was designed with Plane in mind.
- Knowledge visibility (`private` / `shared` / `organization`) is enforced server-side; the frontend only needs to show the relevant tab filter.
- File uploads use the two-step presigned URL pattern — the client never sends file bytes through the NestJS API server.
- MobX stores call service methods directly (not SWR) for write operations; SWR is used optionally for high-frequency read-only data (labels, persons list) to get automatic background revalidation.
